<#3cc896>CHAIN GAUGE / CHAIN COMBO</>
Chain Combo (chain gauge full)		^X
  Her hits fill the chain gauge (bottom of the screen): normals
  a little, specials more, supers a little per hit, blocked hits
  a trickle. At full, X starts the chain combo for 3 seconds
  (no meter cost): short invulnerable start, every normal and
  special cancels into the next, the juggle limit is lifted.
  The bar shows the time left, then the gauge is empty.
  Also cancels a normal on contact.

<#3cc896>SYSTEM</>
Parry		^Z
  Catches any attack. A whiff costs 80 meter and leaves her
  open.
Grab		_F^Y / _B^Y
  Hold forward or back for the switch throw.
Burst (while being hit)		^A_+^B_+^C
  Invincible, no damage, hard knockdown. 75 second cooldown.
  Refills faster once a combo on her passes 15% of her life.
Zero Counter (1 bar, while blocking)		_B_DB_D^A / ^B / ^C
Dash / Back Step		_F_F / _B_B
High Jump		_D_U
Taunt		START

<#3cc896>NORMALS</>
Gatling		^A > ^B > ^C
  Standing, crouching and air normals cancel upward only on hit or
  block (A > B > C, never back down or the same button). Every
  normal that connected also cancels into specials, EX moves and
  supers.
Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C
Forward Medium (punch)		_F^A
Forward Heavy (punch)		_F^C
Senseless Chatter (forward medium kick)		_F^B
Crouching Light / Medium / Heavy		_D^A / _D^B / _D^C
Air Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C
At Wasteland (air, down + medium)		_D^B

